### Create wishlist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishlists?ownerId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Новый год",
  "description": "Список подарков"
}

### Get wishlist by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishlists/1

### Wishlist not found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishlists/999

### List user wishlists
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishlists?ownerId=1

### Update wishlist
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/wishlists/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Новый год 2027",
  "description": "Обновлённый список"
}

### Delete wishlist
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wishlists/2

### Verify deletion
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishlists/2

### Create item
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishlists/1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Наушники Sony WH-1000XM5",
  "url": "https://example.com/headphones",
  "price": 29990.00,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/img.jpg"
}

### List wishlist items
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishlists/1/items

### Get item
GET http://localhost:8080/api/items/3

### Update item
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/items/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Наушники Sony WH-1000XM5 (чёрные)",
  "url": "https://example.com/headphones",
  "price": 27990.00,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/img.jpg"
}

### Delete item
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/items/3

### Item not found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/items/999

### Item without name (validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishlists/1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "url": "https://example.com/x"
}